      ":question/problem": "A curve is defined by the parametric equations\n$x = 4\\cos 3t + 12, y = 1\\sin 3t + 8, 0 \\le t < \\frac{2π}{3}$.\n\nDetermine the values of $t$ at which the normal to the curve is horizontal.",
